/*
  iRestaurant - migrate an existing database from the original Turkish schema to the English schema.

  Run once against a copy/backup of the old database (e.g. the attached iRestaurant.mdf):
      sqlcmd -S <server> -d iRestaurant -i Database/Migrate-TurkishSchemaToEnglish.sql
